  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The best way to get comfortable with Unity is practice, practice, practice. Why not add another mural to your scene to get some more practice with the <b>Move</b> and <b>Rotate</b> tools, and spruce up the playground scene a bit while you\u2019re at it? \n\nThis optional challenge is classified as Medium difficulty."
